<title>USA: Arnold Palmer Golf Co Q2 net sales rise.</title>
<headline>Arnold Palmer Golf Co Q2 net sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>OOLTEWAH, Tenn. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net sales		  5,680		    4,800</p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS ENDED AUGUST 31</p>
<p> Net sales		 16,900		   13,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company took an $800,000 charge during the second quarter of 1996, reporting a net loss of $2 million for the period and $1.3 million in the first six months of fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>NOTE: Corresponding per share and net income figures were not obtainable for 1995.</p>
</text>
